<title>ITALY: Italian crude oil imports up 1.7 pct in Jan-Oct.</title>
<headline>Italian crude oil imports up 1.7 pct in Jan-Oct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian imports of crude oil amounted to 61.1 million tonnes in the first 10 months of 1996, up 1.7 percent from the same period of 1995, industry association Unione Petrolifera said in a statement.</p>
<p>Libya accounted for 32.1 percent of imports, Iran 18.1 percent, Saudi Arabia 13.9 percent, the former Soviet Union 12.6 percent and Syria 4.8 percent.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
